  "content": "<h1>標籤頁調整</h1><p>對Minecraft標籤頁/玩家列表HUD的改進與自定義功能</p><h2>功能特色</h2><h3>視覺效果</h3><ul>\n<li>最大玩家數顯示</li>\n<li>移除標題列</li>\n<li>移除頁尾</li>\n<li>移除玩家頭像</li>\n<li>改進玩家頭飾顯示</li>\n<li>移除延遲圖示</li>\n<li>顯示數值延遲</li>\n<li>調整數值延遲縮放</li>\n<li>隱藏虛假延遲</li>\n</ul><h3>位置調整</h3><ul>\n<li>下移標籤列表</li>\n<li>將標籤列表移至Boss血條下方</li>\n</ul><h3>標籤顏色</h3><ul>\n<li>標題列顏色</li>\n<li>主體顏色</li>\n<li>頁尾顏色</li>\n<li>玩家小工具顏色</li>\n</ul><h3>延遲顏色</h3><ul>\n<li>0-75毫秒延遲</li>\n<li>75-145毫秒延遲</li>\n<li>145-200毫秒延遲</li>\n<li>200-300毫秒延遲</li>\n<li>300-400毫秒延遲</li>\n<li>400毫秒以上延遲</li>\n</ul><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fmicrocontrollers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n  <img alt=\"kofi-singular-alt\" height=\"56\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/donate/kofi-singular-alt_vector.svg\">\n</a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcodeberg.org%252fMicrocontrollersDev%252fTabTweaks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n  <img alt=\"codeberg\" height=\"56\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/available/codeberg_vector.svg\">\n</a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252ftabtweaks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n  <img alt=\"modrinth\" height=\"56\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/available/modrinth_vector.svg\">\n</a>",
